  section: 4
  synopsis: "Shape editor"
  summary: "Edit shape content and dimensions in a dedicated interface."
  see_also: "concept.shape, concept.character"
  """
== DESCRIPTION ==
The editor lets you modify shapes directly.
Changes propagate through the wave engine:
editing a shape triggers its dependents to update.
"""
